      "id": "claim_77b94c874ee94fa984288c49d59912f9",
      "statement": "main.py calls load_dotenv(ROOT / \".env\") before importing graph.py, which transitively imports research.py; research.py constructs its chat-model clients (MODEL, READER) at module import time via init_chat_model, so .env must be loaded before that import for API keys and LangSmith variables to be in effect when those clients are built.",
