      "id": "claim_a94996c3cdbb4348a05778b0ba63d88a",
      "statement": "ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is not read directly by this repo's code; it is consumed implicitly by the Anthropic client underlying init_chat_model in research.py. If it is missing or invalid, gdelt and triage still run and checkpoint normally, but the research node fails when the agent first calls the model, stopping the graph before verify/price/output run.",
